# SQLite & Persistent Data Stores
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm
